### Outpass Management API — REST Client Test File
### Install "REST Client" extension in VS Code, then click "Send Request" above each block

@baseUrl = http://localhost:8000
@studentToken = REPLACE_WITH_TOKEN_AFTER_LOGIN
@wardenToken = REPLACE_WITH_TOKEN_AFTER_LOGIN
@gateToken = REPLACE_WITH_TOKEN_AFTER_LOGIN

### ─────────────────────────────────────────
### 1. HEALTH CHECK
### ─────────────────────────────────────────

GET {{baseUrl}}/
Content-Type: application/json

###

### ─────────────────────────────────────────
### 2. AUTH — Login as Student (Alice)
### ─────────────────────────────────────────

# @name studentLogin
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "roll_no": "S001",
  "password": "password123"
}

###

### Login as Warden
# @name wardenLogin
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "roll_no": "W001",
  "password": "password123"
}

###

### Login as Gate Staff
# @name gateLogin
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "roll_no": "G001",
  "password": "password123"
}

###

### Get current user info
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer {{studentToken}}

###

### ─────────────────────────────────────────
### 3. OUTPASS — Submit New Request (Student)
### ─────────────────────────────────────────

POST {{baseUrl}}/api/outpass/
Authorization: Bearer {{studentToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "destination": "Home Town",
  "reason": "Festival Vacation",
  "departure_time": "2026-09-25T08:00:00",
  "return_time": "2026-09-27T20:00:00",
  "contact_details": "9876543210"
}

###

### Get My Requests (Student)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/outpass/my
Authorization: Bearer {{studentToken}}

###

### Get Pending Queue (Warden)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/outpass/pending
Authorization: Bearer {{wardenToken}}

###

### Get Warden History (Approved/Rejected)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/outpass/history
Authorization: Bearer {{wardenToken}}

###

### Get Single Request Detail
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/outpass/1
Authorization: Bearer {{studentToken}}

###

### ─────────────────────────────────────────
### 4. APPROVAL — Warden Actions
### ─────────────────────────────────────────

### Approve Request #3 (Charlie's pending request)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/outpass/3/approve
Authorization: Bearer {{wardenToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "remarks": "Approved for medical visit"
}

###

### Reject a Request
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/outpass/3/reject
Authorization: Bearer {{wardenToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "remarks": "Exams are coming up"
}

###

### ─────────────────────────────────────────
### 5. NOTIFICATIONS
### ─────────────────────────────────────────

### Get All Notifications (Student)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/notifications/
Authorization: Bearer {{studentToken}}

###

### Mark One Notification as Read
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/notifications/read/1
Authorization: Bearer {{studentToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{}

###

### Mark All Read
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/notifications/read-all
Authorization: Bearer {{studentToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{}

###

### ─────────────────────────────────────────
### 6. QR CODE
### ─────────────────────────────────────────

### Generate QR for Alice's approved request (#1)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/qr/generate/1
Authorization: Bearer {{studentToken}}

###

### Validate QR Token (Gate Staff)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/qr/validate
Authorization: Bearer {{gateToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "token": "TEST-QR-ALICE-001"
}

###
